---
layout: base.njk
title: Portfolio
permalink: /portfolio/
description: Podcasts Yamini Ranjan has produced, hosted, and edited, plus press coverage, talks, and panels.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap page-head__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p>
    <h1>Shows, stories, and stages.</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lead">Podcasts I’ve created, produced, and edited — and the newspapers, radio programs, and community stages where my work has been featured.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="media">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Media showcase</p>
      <h2>In the news, on air, and on stage</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="media-grid">
      {%- for m in media %}
      <a class="media-card" href="{{ m.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="media-card__type">{{ m.type }}</span>
        <span class="media-card__outlet">{{ m.outlet }}</span>
        <span class="media-card__title">{{ m.title }}</span>
        <span class="media-card__summary">{{ m.summary }}</span>
        <span class="media-card__meta">{% if m.date %}{{ m.date }} · {% endif %}Read more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Podcast work</p>
      <h2>Selected shows</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="work-list">
      <article class="work">
        <img class="work__art" src="/assets/img/pf-wow.jpg" alt="Women of Wayland Podcast cover art" loading="lazy">
        <div class="work__body">
          <p class="work__role">Creator, host &amp; producer</p>
          <h3>Women of Wayland – The Podcast</h3>
          <p>A podcast born out of the belief that the most unassuming women around us have the most remarkable stories to tell. Now in its fifth season, focused on women in local governance.</p>
          <div class="work__links">
            <a class="link" href="https://womenofwayland.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website</a>
            <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/women-of-wayland-the-podcast/id1471535994" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple Podcasts</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work">
        <img class="work__art" src="/assets/img/pf-nyaf.jpg" alt="Now You Are Free Podcast cover art" loading="lazy">
        <div class="work__body">
          <p class="work__role">Producer &amp; editor</p>
          <h3>Now You Are Free</h3>
          <p>Explores our approach to punishment and incarceration, demonstrating the triumph of the human spirit over adversity and what it takes to turn a life around.</p>
          <div class="work__links">
            <a class="link" href="https://nowyouarefreepod.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website</a>
            <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/now-you-are-free-podcast/id1624253860" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple Podcasts</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work">
        <img class="work__art work__art--wide" src="/assets/img/pf-peacetalks.jpg" alt="Love Is Respect episode art" loading="lazy">
        <div class="work__body">
          <p class="work__role">Episode correspondent</p>
          <h3>Peace Talks Radio</h3>
          <p>Explored the dynamics of dating and breakups among teens with three guests, covering the psychology of domestic violence, in-school prevention programs, and the motivations behind this work.</p>
          <div class="work__links">
            <a class="link" href="https://beta.prx.org/stories/428546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Listen to the episode</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work">
        <div class="work__art work__art--pair">
          <img src="/assets/img/pf-career-safari.jpg" alt="Career Safari podcast cover art" loading="lazy">
          <img src="/assets/img/pf-hope.png" alt="Of Hope &amp; Perseverance podcast cover art" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="work__body">
          <p class="work__role">Audio editor</p>
          <h3>Career Safari &amp; Of Hope and Perseverance</h3>
          <p>Podcast audio editing for two independent shows, from cleanup and story edits to the final mix.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Community</p>
      <h2>Leadership &amp; volunteer work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards cards--2">
      <div class="card card--logo">
        <img src="/assets/img/pf-wayland-seal.jpg" alt="Town of Wayland seal" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>Chair &amp; founding member, HRDEIC</h3>
          <p>Wayland’s Human Rights, Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Committee affirms the town as an inclusive community and defends the rights of all individuals to the free and equal exercise of their human and civil rights.</p>
          <a class="link" href="https://www.wayland.ma.us/human-rights-diversity-equity-and-inclusion-committee" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the committee</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Co-founder, Wayland Multicultural Festival</h3>
        <p>A community celebration launched by the HRDEI Committee in 2022 to bring Wayland residents of every background together.</p>
        <a class="link" href="https://www.waylandpost.org/news/town-getting-ready-for-expanded-wayland-festival/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read in The Wayland Post</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grants">
      <p class="grants__label">Supported by grants from</p>
      <div class="grants__logos">
        <img src="/assets/img/grant-ldamf.jpg" alt="Lauren Dunne Astley Memorial Fund" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/assets/img/grant-village-bank.jpg" alt="The Village Bank" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/assets/img/grant-wayland-cc.png" alt="Wayland Cultural Council" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/assets/img/grant-ifw.png" alt="IFundWomen of Color" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

